    "■ Preset creation: ライブラリ→新規→enter questions & answers (manual/bulk paste/AI Scan)→set mode (EXAM/TURN/RANDOM/WRITE)→save→optionally configure publishing.",
    "■ Preset sharing: Select preset→share→issue 6-char code (valid 10min)→send code to recipient→recipient imports via /s/{code}.",
    "■ Learning session: Select preset→choose mode→configure (question count/time limit/auto-next)→answer→review results (correct/incorrect breakdown)→AI weakness analysis→earn Qredit on EXAM completion.",
    "■ AI Scan: Preset creation screen→upload PDF/images (max 8 files)→AI auto-read→extract questions→QDP quality check→confirm & edit→save.",
    "■ Groop: Groop tab→search public groups or accept invite→join→group chat, posts, collaborative project work.",
    "■ Feed posting: Feed→「いまどうしてる？」→text input (max 4000 chars)→attach images/links→attach learning result card→publish.",

